# Nothing generated by this repo is meant to be committed - all keys and
# certificates live in the `shared` docker volume and are recreated fresh
# on every `docker compose up`. These patterns are just a safety net in
# case anyone experiments with ssh-keygen outside of docker in-place.
*_key
*_key.pub
*-cert.pub
id_ed25519*
ca_key*
*.krl
.DS_Store
